            {
              "id": "1764960467763_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`\n- **Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails }}`\n- **Action Details:** `{{$context.$variables.actionDetails}}`\n- **Communication Details:** `{{$context.$variables.communicationDetails}}`\n- **Login user (email sender):** `{{$context.$user.$name}}`\n\n---\n### **Tasks**\n\n1. **Display the Query Response, summarized and aligned with the Inbound Context Details and User Request:**\n    - Show a summary at the top, highlighting the most relevant context for the user request.\n    - Do **not** include JSON output, action details, actionable insights, or priority actions in the user-facing response text.\n    - Do **not** display `personId` or `assignmentId` in the response text.\n    - Repcounts: x - y in response indicate that employee has x number of Direct reportees and y number of Total reportees.\n\n2. **Using only from available Action Details (actionCode, actionCondition) aligned with User Request, Inbound Context Details and the Query Response:**  \n   - Provide priority actionable insights (ranked by priority, relevance) in below sample format\n{\n  \"title\": \"Suggestion: turn off lights\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"No one was detected in the house, suggest you turn off the lights.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Turn Off Lights\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent(<actionCode>, <actionTitle>, <actionText>, <actionPurpose>)\",\n  \"priority\":\"false\"\n}\n - Include actions along with widgets only if relevant else show separately as action items. \n - consider actions based on actionCondition  \n - use actionCode, actionTitle, actionText, actionPurpose available only from the **Action Details**\n\n4)  **Using only the available Communication Details (commCondition) aligned with User Request, Inbound Context Details and the Query Response:**  \n   - produce an agent-generated email or text alert based on commType.\n     ```json for email type\n     {\n       \"title\": \"<title based on commPurpose or commCode>\",\n       \"shortDescription\": \"<one-line description using commPurpose>\",\n       \"actionText\": \"Send email\",\n       \"type\": \"email\",\n       \"content\": \"<full email body derived from commPrompt; include salutation and closing and sign with {{$context.$user.$name}}>\",\n       \"params\": [\n         { \"id\": \"email\", \"title\": \"email address\", \"defaultValue\": \"\" },\n         { \"id\": \"subject\", \"title\": \"email subject\", \"defaultValue\": \"<short subject derived from commPurpose>\" }\n       ]\n     }\n     ```\n\n     ```json for text type\n     {\n       \"title\": \"<title based on commPurpose or commCode>\",\n       \"shortDescription\": \"<one-line description using commPurpose>\",\n       \"actionText\": \"Alert\",\n       \"type\": \"text\",\n       \"content\": \"<full alert text derived from commPurpose or commPrompt;>\",\n       \"params\": [\n         { \"id\": \"<id>\", \"title\": \"<short subject derived from commPurpose or commPrompt>\", \n           \"defaultValue\": \"<short subject derived from commPurpose or commPrompt>\" }\n       ]\n     }\n     ```\n   - For mail type Do not fabricate recipients; leave the recipient param empty if unknown.\n   - Present communications as low-priority actionable insights (ranked below priority actions).\n   - Output agent-generated communications using the oraComms wrapper (escape tags). Example:  \n     `<oraComms> { ...communication JSON... } </oraComms>`\n\n---\n\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt: `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`  \nChat history: `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
