          "id": "1764964809691",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764964809693_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`\n- **Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails }}`\n\n---\n### **Task Requirements**\n\n1. Generate a concise summary of the Query Response aligning with available Inbound Context Details in **no more than 250 words**. \n- Do not include details regarding actionable insights or priority actions in the response.\n- Do not include `personId`, `assignmentId' in the response text.\n---\n\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt : `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\nChat history : `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
            }
